	(text "J15 SERVO 24V and J17 SERVO UART: same pinout\nas CN5 / CN13 on the MES2 Harvester, so its cables fit.\nThe FE-URT-2 turns the UART into the Feetech half-duplex\nservo bus and passes the 24 V on to the servos.\nUART from the SC16IS740 I²C bridge (Winch\nsheet, 0x48): TX → pin 4, pin 3 → RX.\nF9 3 A PTC on the servo 24 V. F10 1.1 A PTC on the\nFE-URT-2 5 V, fed from the screen converter so a\nservo-side short can't pull down the module supply.\n24 V only for 24 V servo types.\nNo module GPIO used (MES4 standard pin map)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 294.64 198.12 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "5e5873ad-6574-5469-b529-b76b5da719b4")
	)
